---
import ContactSection from '../ContactSection.astro';
---

<section class="dk" style="font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 88px clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px) 96px; color: #ffffff; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0A2F6E 0%, #06255A 55%, #051F4C 100%)">
  <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 24px; align-items: center">
    <div style="flex: 1 1 400px; max-width: 500px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; align-items: flex-start">
      <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F58220; border: 1px solid #F58220; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px">Levier 03 · Tout gérer</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: Satoshi,Inter,sans-serif; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px); line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Votre entreprise dans un seul outil, <span style="color: #F58220">sur mesure</span>.</h1>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C3D0EA; max-width: 480px">Demandes, devis, factures, chantiers, relances : tout est centralisé dans un outil construit pour votre façon de travailler, et relié à vos autres outils.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 24px">
        <a class="ab1" href="#contact">
          <span>Voir l'outil en visio</span>
          <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase">30 min · gratuit</span>
        </a>
        <a class="lk dkl" href="#sur-mesure" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; color: #ffffff">Voir le détail <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1.6 1 560px; min-width: 0">
      <div class="mr">
        <div class="mri" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 30px; width: 1000px">
          <div style="position: relative; width: 1000px; transform: perspective(2200px) rotateY(-9deg) rotateX(3deg); transform-origin: left center">
            <div style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 1000px; height: 580px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 26px; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #2A3245, #0C1220); box-shadow: 0 50px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 2px #3A4357, 0 0 120px rgba(245,130,32,0.16)">
              <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: #EEF1FB">
                <div style="display: flex; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: #EEF1FB; color: #06255A; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif">
                  <div style="flex: none; width: 170px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 16px 12px; background: #ffffff; border-right: 1px solid #E1E6F5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
                    <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0 6px 12px">
                      <span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 9px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB020, #F58220); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">A</span>
                      <b style="font-size: 16px">Aplomb</b>
                    </span>
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 9px 10px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; background: #FFF1E3; color: #B45309"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" /><rect x="13" y="4" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" /><rect x="4" y="13" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" /><rect x="13" y="13" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5" /></svg>Tableau de bord</div>
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 9px 10px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #5B6B8F"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2.5" /><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h4" /></svg>Devis</div>
