                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 9px 10px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #5B6B8F"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="2.5" /><path d="M8.5 7.5h7M9 12h.01M12 12h.01M15 12h.01M9 16h.01M12 16h.01M15 16h.01" /></svg>Comptabilité</div>
