              </svg>
            </span>
            <span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.3">
              <b style="font-size: 14px">Facture payée</b>
              <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #5B6B8F">Extension · à l'instant</span>
            </span>
